  "This historic mission was called Apollo 11.",
  "A massive Saturn V rocket launched the crew from Florida.",
  "The spacecraft had three parts, but only the command module returned to Earth.",
  "Neil Armstrong and Buzz Aldrin landed the lunar module Eagle.",
  "Meanwhile, Michael Collins stayed alone in orbit.",
  "They safely touched down in the Sea of Tranquility."
